Tell the web UI where this deployment's push-to-talk speech server is.

push_to_talk_url in the environment file (OMNIGENT_PUSH_TO_TALK_URL) is a
Voxtral Realtime server on the tailnet, such as
wss://mac-mini.tail1234.ts.net:8443. GET /v1/info passes it on as
push_to_talk_url, or null when it's unset; the composer's hold-to-talk mic
button shows only when it's set, and streams the microphone straight to
that server (web-patches/0040-push-to-talk.patch). Omnigent's own server
never handles the audio.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d), after 0024-hermes-host.patch.
